# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Build outputs ---
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.output/
**/out/

# --- Tool caches ---
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.turbo/
**/.vite/
**/.eslintcache
**/.tsbuildinfo

# --- Logs ---
**/logs/
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Environment files / secrets ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

# --- Runtime / uploads (adjust if you want to version these) ---
**/uploads/
**/storage/
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

.idea/
*.iml

# --- Misc ---
**/*.pid
**/*.seed
**/*.bak
